        "id": 3969818043,
        "type": null,
        "body": "MR !26 merged on 2026-10-07 (`632b50242`). Its `8e7b0b073` fixes the hash part described above:\n`remove_obj_from_rnum_hash()` leaves alone a chain the object does not head, so removing a letter\nno longer empties the bucket. The rest is still open: the instance count of rnum 1, and an OLC\nsave or a new prototype below it treating the letters as that prototype's objects.",
